{"success":true,"data":{"id":"cell-arxdo2-mrw8hnh7r24","title":"Combat Rules Engine (LOS + Attack + Damage + Heat + PSR)","description":"Implement the complete BattleTech combat resolution system. Pure logic modules - no UI.\n\n**Dependencies:** Uses HexGrid, HexMath from subtask 2, Unit/GameState/Weapon models from subtask 1, dice utility.\n\n**Files to create:**\n- `src/rules/combat/LineOfSight.js` - LOS calculation:\n  - `calculateLOS(fromKey, toKey, gameState)` - Returns { blocked: boolean, partialCover: boolean, woodsCount: number, waterDepth: number, interveningHexes: [] }\n  - Uses hexLine() from HexMath to trace the line\n  - Check terrain height at each intervening hex (woods add +2 height per level)\n  - Partial cover: target hex has elevation 0 and line passes through level-1 hex within 2 hexes\n  - Blocked if accumulated height difference exceeds line-of-sight clearance\n  - Water submergence: depth 1 = legs only, depth 2 = no attacks possible\n  - Woods blocking: 3+ light woods hexes or 1+ heavy woods hexes between = blocked\n\n- `src/rules/combat/AttackResolver.js` - Attack resolution (G.A.T.O.R.):\n  - `resolveWeaponAttack(attacker, weapon, target, gameState, diceRoller)` - Full attack resolution\n  - Base TN = gunnery skill\n  - G.A.T.O.R. modifiers:\n    - G (Gunnery): base gunnery skill\n    - A (Attacker): movement modifier (+0 stationary, +1 walk, +2 run, +3 jump)\n    - T (Target): movement modifier (+0 stationary, +1 walk/run, +2 jump, +3 sprint), terrain (+1 light woods, +2 heavy woods), prone (+1), immobile (-4)\n    - O (Other): heat (+1 per 5 heat over 0), damage (+1 per location with 20+ damage), pilot hits (+1 per hit), woods between (+1 per 2 woods hexes)\n    - R (Range): +0 medium, +2 short, +4 long (adjusted for weapon type)\n  - Roll 2d6, if  then hit\n  - `determineHitLocation(attackDirection, diceRoller)` - 2D6 roll for hit location (front/side/rear based on attack direction)\n  - `resolveClusterHit(weapon, location, diceRoller)` - For SRM/LRM, roll cluster table to determine how many missiles hit\n  - `resolveAmmoChoice(weapon, attacker)` - Select ammo type (standard, cluster, inferno, etc.)\n\n- `src/rules/combat/DamageResolver.js` - Damage application:\n  - `applyDamage(unit, location, damage, isRear)` - Armor → internal → critical hits\n  - `applyCriticalHit(unit, location, slotIndex, diceRoller)` - Effect depends on what's in the slot (ammo explosion, weapon destroyed, engine hit, gyro hit, pilot hit, etc.)\n  - `destroyLocation(unit, location)` - Remove location, transfer damage to torso\n  - `checkAmmoExplosion(unit, location, diceRoller)` - If ammo bin hit, roll for explosion\n  - CASE: contains ammo explosions to that location\n  - Head destruction = mechwarrior death = unit destroyed\n  - Center torso internal destruction = unit destroyed\n  - Leg/arm destruction effects\n  - Engine hits: 2+ = shutdown\n  - Gyro hits: 2+ = fall (auto-fail PSR)\n  - Pilot hits: consciousness check at end of phase\n\n- `src/rules/heat/HeatManager.js` - Heat tracking:\n  - `calculateHeatGeneration(unit, weaponsFired, movementType)` - Sum heat from all weapons fired + movement heat (running +1, jumping +heatPerHex)\n  - `applyHeatDissipation(unit, gameState)` - Dissipate heat based on heat sinks (10 single or 5 double per turn), modified by water (double in depth 1)\n  - `applyHeatEffects(unit)` - Heat level effects:\n    - 0-4: no effect\n    - 5-9: +1 TN to-hit\n    - 10-14: +2 TN, -1 walk MP\n    - 15-19: +3 TN, -2 walk MP, ammo explosion check (8+ on 2d6)\n    - 20-23: +4 TN, -3 walk MP, shutdown check (on 2d6, 4+ = shutdown)\n    - 24+: automatic shutdown, ammo explosion check\n  - `checkShutdown(unit, diceRoller)` - Roll for involuntary shutdown\n  - `checkAmmoExplosion(unit, diceRoller)` - Roll for heat-induced ammo explosion\n\n- `src/rules/combat/PhysicalAttackResolver.js` - Physical attacks:\n  - `resolvePunch(attacker, target, diceRoller)` - Punch attack (uses arms, 1 damage per 10 tons, target in front arc)\n  - `resolveKick(attacker, target, diceRoller)` - Kick attack (uses legs, 1 damage per 5 tons, PSR if miss)\n  - `resolveCharge(attacker, target, path, diceRoller)` - Charge attack (movement + damage to both)\n  - `resolveDFA(attacker, target, path, diceRoller)` - Death From Above (jump + massive damage, attacker takes leg damage)\n  - `resolvePush(attacker, target, diceRoller)` - Push attempt (PSR for both)\n  - Physical attack TN = piloting skill + modifiers","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-07-22T15:25:11.323Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:25:53.531Z","parent_id":"cell-arxdo2-mrw8hnfu6i6","dependencies":[],"metadata":{}}}
